 Agent Studio   Chat  Grid  Overview                                        ● 4/6 running  YOLO off
╭ Key bindings ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮
│ Prefix: Ctrl+A  then a key; every other key goes to the agent                                    │
│ Keys without a prefix work in the sidebar, grid and scroll mode as named below.                  │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Navigation                                                                                       │
│  Ctrl+A g  Ctrl+A \                            Toggle Chat / Grid View                           │
│  Ctrl+A O                                      Show Overview                                     │
│  Ctrl+A v                                      Cycle Chat / Grid / Overview                      │
│  Ctrl+A 1-9                                    Switch to agent by index                          │
│  Ctrl+A j  Ctrl+A Down                         Next Agent                                        │
│  Ctrl+A k  Ctrl+A Up                           Previous Agent                                    │
│  Ctrl+A s  grid Tab                            Focus Sidebar                                     │
│  Ctrl+A /  sidebar /                           Focus Sidebar Search                              │
│  sidebar Esc  sidebar Tab                      Back to the Terminal / Grid                       │
│                                                                                                  │
│ Agents                                                                                           │
│  Ctrl+A n  sidebar n                           New Agent                                         │
│  Ctrl+A o  sidebar o                           Resume Session…                                   │
│  Ctrl+A P  sidebar P                           Claude Profile of the Project                     │
│  Ctrl+A x  sidebar x                           Stop Selected Agent                               │
│  Ctrl+A R  sidebar R                           Restart Selected Agent                            │
│  Ctrl+A d  Ctrl+A Del  sidebar d  sidebar Del  Remove Selected Agent                             │
│  Ctrl+A r  sidebar r                           Rename Selected Agent                             │
│  Ctrl+A y  sidebar y                           Toggle YOLO for Selected Agent                    │
│  Ctrl+A Y  sidebar Y                           Toggle Global YOLO                                │
│                                                                                                  │
